    {
      "id": 239273,
      "name": "Joel",
      "username": "cajunjoel",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cajunjoel/{size}/1846_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-07-14T02:17:07.258Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Late to the party here, but I’m going to guess it was this setting:</p>\n<p><strong>body min entropy</strong><br>\n<em>The minimum entropy (unique characters, non-english count for more) required for a post body.</em></p>\n<p>It was set to 7, which should be enough to allow “ALL THE WOOD!!!” to be posted (it’s 8 unique characters).</p>\n<p>I just changed it to 5, so you still probably can’t post the following:</p>\n<p><strong>Wooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooot!</strong><br>\nor<br>\n<strong>Heeeeeyyyyyyy…</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-07-14T02:17:07.258Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": 5,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 15,
      "readers_count": 14,
      "score": 93.0,
