      "user_title": "",
      "reply_to_user": {
        "username": "Godai",
        "name": "Godai",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/godai/{size}/1920_2.png"
      },
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Late to the party here, but I'm going to guess it was this setting:\n\n**body min entropy**\n*The minimum entropy (unique characters, non-english count for more) required for a post body.*\n\nIt was set to 7, which should be enough to allow \"ALL THE WOOD!!!\" to be posted (it's 8 unique characters).\n\nI just changed it to 5, so you still probably can't post the following: \n\n**Wooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooot!** \nor \n**Heeeeeyyyyyyy.....**\n\n:slight_smile:",
